ex encounters into clever triumphs. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIMENTATION &amp; EXPRESSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like your favorite  card games, <strong>Sleight of Hand</strong> encourages you to experiment with card synergies. Whether you lure guards into <i>Honey Traps</i>, link multiple targets’ fates, or vanish into mist at the perfect moment, the goal is to feel clever by finding that perfect card combo to outwit  those on your tail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/dde114b65c063444e175eeba1e20d3e6.poster.avif?t=1778541283\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/dde114b65c063444e175eeba1e20d3e6.webm?t=1778541283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAYER DRIVEN PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your own leads, find passwords in abandoned matchbooks, slip through hidden passages, and strike your old coven from unexpected angles. Adapt your route on the fly, reacting to the city’s shifting patrols and secretive inhabitants. Over time, grow more powerful, find new strategies, and discover unexpected interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/00f51bd12e0211c8d4a66359d1f81341.poster.avif?t=1778541283\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets